    {
      "id": "challenge-wealth",
      "seconds": 22,
      "heading": "A challenge: the richest customer",
      "narration": "Here is a short coding challenge, from {LeetCode|leet code}. Each row is a customer. Each column is a bank account. Find the richest customer. Sum along axis two, for a total for each customer. Then take the largest. The answer is ten.",
