    {
      "id": "challenge-negatives",
      "seconds": 22,
      "heading": "A challenge: count the negatives",
      "narration": "One more. Count the negative numbers in a grid. Compare the grid with zero. That gives a mask of ones and zeros. Then reduce along both {axes|@axes}, with subscript one two. There are eight.",
