      "id": "gpus",
      "seconds": 16,
      "heading": "Tensors on a GPU",
      "narration": "The {GPU|@gpu} works on many values at once. Shape and {axes|@axes} tell it how a tensor is laid out. The ideas in this episode are the same ones. We will come back to tensors in later episodes.",
